Foot-pedal mapping and debounce/double-tap behavior adapted from
https://github.com/ValentinJaeung/lerobot-footpedal
commit c215176d3f8530e76d482f665544c1b3e312ff42 (pedal_bridge.py).
New integration uses a direct event queue, not the original UInput bridge.

